     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello all!<div><br></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46)\">Wanted to introduce you the TSstudio package for time series analysis. It provides a set of interactive visualization tools (which based on the plotly visualization engine)  for time series analysis supporting ts, mts, zoo and xts objects along some of the outputs of the forecast package. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46)\">First version available on CRAN or Github.</span></font><br></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46)\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46)\">For more information:</span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#24292e\">Package Vignette - </font></font><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/TSstudio/vignettes/TSstudio_Intro.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/TSstudio/vignettes/TSstudio_Intro.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496522811000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mpIwun3DnT0RzKh0zLTt5\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/TSstudio/vignettes/TSstudio_Intro.html</a></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#24292e\"><br></font></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#24292e\">Github page - <a href=\"https://github.com/RamiKrispin/TSstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/RamiKrispin/TSstudio&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496522811000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2vNyuEkzO1umjuDTaKIG7f\">https://github.com/RamiKrispin/TSstudio</a></font><br></font></div><div><br></div><div><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Thanks,</font></div><div><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Rami</font></div></div>"
